# Tests create scratch files/dirs here at runtime and remove them on success;
# keep the directory tracked but ignore everything written into it.
#
# Checked-in fixtures must be un-ignored BY NAME. A fixture that an Assert.Manifest
# test names as its `source:` is not scratch output — if it is ignored it still
# passes locally, where the file is on disk, and silently stops testing anything on
# a fresh clone.
*
!.gitignore
!write-content-literal.yaml
